WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.854
Start at the admin sign-in page.

00:00:02.904 --> 00:00:06.686
Enter your email and password, then choose Sign in.

00:00:06.736 --> 00:00:10.292
This recording uses a separate training account.

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:12.396
If you forget your password,

00:00:12.446 --> 00:00:17.354
use the reset link beneath the form to request a new one by email.
